          "path": "_m/6/2/7/q/chiloe-national-park-wk/desfontainia-spinosa-316353566.jpg",
          "filename": "Desfontainia spinosa (3163535664).jpg",
          "caption": "Desfontainia spinosa Ruiz &amp; Pav.\n20090101\nParque Nacional Chiloe, Chile\n\nI thought for sure this was a holly tree the first time I saw it with just an old fruit.  Once you are fortunate enough to see the beautiful flower, however, all doubt is removed!",
